.B \&.docked(side: Side, size: Dim)
Docks the layer against an edge instead of centering it, sized \fBsize\fR along the axis across that edge (\fBDim::Fixed\fR, a \fBFraction\fR, \fBFill\fR, or \fBAuto\fR for its own size) and full along it: a bottom sheet, a drawer. It slides in from that edge.
