.B \&.along(length: Dim, align: Align)
How long a docked layer is along its edge, and where along it (default the whole edge). Like \fBdocked\fR's size it is a \fBDim\fR: \fBFixed\fR, a \fBFraction\fR, \fBFill\fR or \fBAuto\fR.
.TP
.B \&.margin(px: f32)
Distance in px between a docked layer and the edge it is docked to, and no other: 0 (the default) is flush with that edge. A press in the gap is a press outside.
